{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/6d77e83886db6e09d316921b659a2765.avif?t=1765031262\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever sold random junk in an RPG and wondered where it goes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>To you!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Lootcycle</strong>, you\u2019re the craftsman who buys scraps, turns it into unique loot and trades with adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/7358d7604f39ebe7034a4195ff087d12.avif?t=1765031262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras_big/7358d7604f39ebe7034a4195ff087d12.webp?t=1765031262 width=1560 height=1043 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work with different materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal, wood, bones, monster parts and many more \u2014 each one changes how your creation looks and performs. Mix and match to discover strange combos and powerful effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get creative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your loot piece by piece. Mix handles, blades and decorations to design something truly yours \u2014 from elegant weapons to total disasters that somehow work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade with adventurers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client has quirks and questionable taste. Haggle, improvise, or sell them whatever shiny thing you have lying around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools and rare materials to expand your craft and attract new customers. The better your setup, the wilder your creativity can get.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518470?t=1765031262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/7fa9aa8bb219c9c8cfdb8ee3dec93569a8fdd09a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765031262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/c4baeb0519b95502dfc93cac88453231c4437445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765031262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/c4baeb0519b95502dfc93cac88453231c4437445/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765031262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/6d77e83886db6e09d316921b659a2765.avif?t=1765031262\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever sold random junk in an RPG and wondered where it goes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>To you!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Lootcycle</strong>, you\u2019re the craftsman who buys scraps, turns it into unique loot and trades with adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras/7358d7604f39ebe7034a4195ff087d12.avif?t=1765031262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/extras_big/7358d7604f39ebe7034a4195ff087d12.webp?t=1765031262 width=1560 height=1043 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work with different materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal, wood, bones, monster parts and many more \u2014 each one changes how your creation looks and performs. Mix and match to discover strange combos and powerful effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get creative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your loot piece by piece. Mix handles, blades and decorations to design something truly yours \u2014 from elegant weapons to total disasters that somehow work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade with adventurers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client has quirks and questionable taste. Haggle, improvise, or sell them whatever shiny thing you have lying around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools and rare materials to expand your craft and attract new customers. The better your setup, the wilder your creativity can get.</p>","developers":["Possum Riot"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518470/8b23a13acecae3e2d5052cd5a36f566e850753ff/header.jpg?t=1765031262","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz or faster processor (Apple Silicon &amp; Intel supported)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal or OpenGL 3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3518470/824823719/bdaf8f9168248db93c7af6b500d12f4486d43e9e/1762525772/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762526369","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3518470/824823719/bdaf8f9168248db93c7af6b500d12f4486d43e9e/1762525772/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762526369","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3518470/824823719/bdaf8f9168248db93c7af6b500d12f4486d43e9e/1762525772/hls_